# GeoSAM2 — configuration template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# The .env file is NOT committed to git (.gitignore).
#
# Usage:
#   cp .env.dist .env
#   # edit .env
#   python app.py             # step-by-step app  -> http://127.0.0.1:7862
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── API keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Gemini API key — required only for the VLM stage (describe + part map).
# Get yours at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: only needed by a model named below that runs on that provider.
# Get yours at: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Get yours at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Serves any provider above whose own key is empty, Gemini included: https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# ── VLM ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The models behind the seed: one describes the object, one paints its part map.
# pydantic-ai names, provider:model.
# GEOSAM2_DESCRIBE_MODEL=google:gemini-3.7-flash
# GEOSAM2_PAINT_MODEL=google:gemini-3.1-flash-image

# Tried in order when the model above fails, comma-separated; a model whose provider
# has no key goes through OpenRouter, or is skipped. Unset or empty: the defaults shown.
# GEOSAM2_DESCRIBE_FALLBACKS=anthropic:claude-sonnet-5,openai:gpt-5.6-luna
# GEOSAM2_PAINT_FALLBACKS=google:gemini-2.5-flash-image


# ── Development ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Log level. DEBUG adds the per-part pixel coverage of a generated mask.
# GEOSAM2_LOG_LEVEL=INFO


# ── Server ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Host and port for app.py (uncomment to override the defaults shown).
# GEOSAM2_APP_HOST=127.0.0.1
# GEOSAM2_APP_PORT=7862
